n'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:"Calibri Light";font-size:20.0pt'>How to
conduct Exams</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.0409in;margin-left:.0215in;width:2.=
2458in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
Monday,
June 15, 2026</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.0pt;color:#767676'>=
3:13
AM</p>

</div>

<div style=3D'direction:ltr;margin-top:.4118in;margin-left:0in;width:7.3951=
in'>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image001.png"
width=3D342 height=3D267></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'><span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=C2=A0 </span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Go to user dro=
p down
menu and click on Your Tests.</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>You will land on 'Creat=
or
     Dashboard'.</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>You will find all the t=
est
     you have created so far.</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image002.png"
width=3D352 height=3D283></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Find your test=
-card
that you are going to conduct among your candidates.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Click on the
&quot;conduct&quot; of the test-card.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>[You can click=
 on
&quot;View&quot; to see your final live test view. You can recheck
questions/options/timing/sections and all.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>If you want to=
 make
change in your test then you can select &quot;edit test&quot; option from t=
hree
dot menu of the test card.]</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:3</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image003.png"
width=3D339 height=3D408></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>A pop up windo=
w will
open where you can find and regenerate unlisted link of the test card.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Select &quot;S=
tart
Conducting&quot; to active the test.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:4</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image004.png"
width=3D410 height=3D186></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Now your test =
is
live and only accessible via link only.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>You can see the=
 four
options:<br />
i. Settings: where you can apply proctoring, schedule your test and more.<br
/>
ii. Results: where you can see the only submitted results when test is in
Active Exam mode(conduct mode).</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Iii. Copy link=
: To
copy your exam link.<br />
iv. Remove: To stop exam.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Click on
&quot;Settings&quot;.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:5</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image005.png"
width=3D427 height=3D297></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>You will land =
on
&quot;Test Environment Settings&quot;.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Choose your
proctoring preferences.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Click on access
&amp; control section for more.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:6</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image006.png"
width=3D430 height=3D268></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Turn on Attempt
Limit and start form for single attempt and collect details before starting=
 the
exam respectively.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Now go to
&quot;Result &amp; Timing&quot; section.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:7</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image007.png"
width=3D480 height=3D305></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Start Server s=
ide
timing and disable &quot;Flexible Timer&quot;.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Now Save Setti=
ngs by
clicking on &quot;Save Settings&quot; button below the Test Environment
settings.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:8</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image008.png"
width=3D456 height=3D162></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Now you can co=
py the
link and share with your candidates to take the fare examinations.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Results: you c=
an
view the Submitted Results from Results dashboard.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Step:9</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Remove: you ca=
n stop
taking responses by removing the test from Active Exam mode.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'><img src=3D"HowtoconductExams_files/image009.png"
width=3D382 height=3D307></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>When you remov=
e exam
from active exam mode. You will see two options:</p>

<ol type=3Da style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;margi=
n-bottom:
 0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:nor=
mal'>
 <li value=3D1 style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'=
><span
     style=3D'font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt;font-weight:normal;font-=
style:
     normal;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Stop &amp; Make Public: A=
llow
     candidates to analyse exam. Anonymous students can also access.</span>=
</li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Stop &amp; Make Private:
     Restrict all further access. Results and exam not visible to anyone.</=
span></li>
</ol>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'>Aftar choosing=
 any
of the option, your test will be Inactive.</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div>

<p style=3D'margin:0in'>&nbsp;</p>

